Ola Maps | Ola Maps API Reference > POST /routing/v1/directions/basic

POST /routing/v1/directions/basic
Directions Basic API
Provides a lightweight route between two or more points with essential metadata such as distance, duration, and geometry. This excludes real-time traffic data.

Parameters:

- x-request-id (header, optional): Unique request ID for tracing and logging. {"type": "string"}

- x-correlation-id (header, optional): Correlation ID for distributed tracing across systems. {"type": "string"}

- origin (query, required): Origin coordinates in the format lat,lng. {"type": "string"}

- destination (query, required): Destination coordinates in the format lat,lng. {"type": "string"}

- waypoints (query, optional): Optional waypoints joined by '|' separator in lat,lng format. Up to 10 waypoints. {"type": "string"}

- alternatives (query, optional): Whether multiple routes should be returned. {"type": "boolean", "default": false}

- steps (query, optional): Whether step-by-step instructions are included. {"type": "boolean", "default": true}

- overview (query, optional): Level of overview geometry - full, simplified, or false. {"type": "string", "default": "full"}

Ola Maps | Directions API - Ola Maps Platform > Sample request with waypoints

```
curl --location --request POST "https://api.olamaps.io/routing/v1/directions?origin=18.76029027465273,73.3814242364375&destination=18.73354223011708,73.44587966939002&waypoints=18.75171540179755%2C%2073.4067693460594&api_key=${your_api_key}" --header "X-Request-Id: XXX"
```

Please refer to the API documentation for further details.

